{"articleNo":"2368","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2368&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-2학기 대학원(산업 및 교육) 강의평가 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.19","hit":"13686","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"639\" bgcolor=\"#cde4fa\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2009-2학기 대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 강의평가 안내 </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"></span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2009학년도 2학기 대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원의 강의평가를 아래와 같이 실시하오니,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 수강학생은 빠짐없이 강의평가를 이행하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">◆&nbsp;&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp;&nbsp; ◆</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">1. 대상강좌 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2009학년도 2학기에 대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원에 개설된 모든 강좌</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(단, 석ㆍ박사 논문연구지도 과목은 제외함)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 2.8pt\">대상자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2009학년도 2학기 대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원의 강좌별 수강학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">3. 평가기간 :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">2009. 11. 23.(월) ～ 12. 6.(일) [2주간]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">4. 강의평가 형태 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">우리대학교 인터넷 홈페이지를 이용한 설문평가 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">5. 접속방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><strong><u>우리대학교 홈페이지/원스톱서비스/로그인/수업(학생)/대학원 강의평가</u></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><font size=\"5\">2009.&nbsp;&nbsp; 11.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\"><font size=\"5\">대학원장(산업대학원장, 교육대학원장)</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
